WEBVTT

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:23.050
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:30.190
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:36.870
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:42.840
I was searching for your smile

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:50.210
With our memories fading

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:57.290
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:04.190
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:11.410
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:31.620 --> 00:01:36.180
Damn!  I thought I won, but he's tough!

00:01:36.180 --> 00:01:38.780
I'm physically at my limits.

00:01:38.780 --> 00:01:40.970
It's pretty bad.

00:01:40.970 --> 00:01:44.620
But I haven't had such a heated duel in a while.

00:01:44.980 --> 00:01:48.650
This fight is exciting, Valon!

00:01:48.650 --> 00:01:51.770
Dueling you is the best!

00:01:51.770 --> 00:01:55.660
If only the stakes weren't so high...

00:01:55.660 --> 00:02:01.670
After the Fight

00:02:07.930 --> 00:02:09.110
Wait a sec!

00:02:10.010 --> 00:02:12.110
We have to hurry!

00:02:12.110 --> 00:02:15.620
Jonouchi must be dueling right now!

00:02:15.620 --> 00:02:18.620
If he loses, he’ll lose his soul!

00:02:18.620 --> 00:02:22.160
I know!  But the map says he’s around here!

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:25.370
We have to search the alleys.

00:02:28.010 --> 00:02:29.310
Yugi?

00:02:30.940 --> 00:02:32.000
What’s wrong?

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:33.330
Just now...

00:02:33.850 --> 00:02:38.840
I sensed that Jonouchi’s Claw of Hermos activated.

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:40.970
What's this?

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:46.560
Jonouchi...

00:02:48.300 --> 00:02:51.870
But I don’t sense anything now.

00:02:51.870 --> 00:02:54.020
Does that mean Jonouchi lost?

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:55.020
Honda!

00:02:55.710 --> 00:02:56.520
Yugi.

00:02:56.520 --> 00:02:59.800
Let's find Jonouchi!

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:15.930
Not bad, Valon.

00:03:15.930 --> 00:03:18.310
I thought I had you.

00:03:18.310 --> 00:03:20.990
You’re good too, Jonouchi.

00:03:20.990 --> 00:03:24.820
Nobody has fought me this well.

00:03:24.820 --> 00:03:29.310
You’re #1 when it comes to toughness!

00:03:29.740 --> 00:03:31.610
What a duel!

00:03:31.610 --> 00:03:37.600
They're fighting hard, but neither's spirit is breaking.

00:03:37.600 --> 00:03:44.840
A duel this heated is what I was looking for!

00:03:44.840 --> 00:03:47.170
I want to fight too!

00:03:50.240 --> 00:03:54.710
Since I activated Aura Armor, I have to pay half my life points!

00:03:55.940 --> 00:03:59.980
I set two cards and end my turn!

00:03:59.980 --> 00:04:02.220
My turn.  I draw!

00:04:02.980 --> 00:04:07.460
During my Standby Phase, I Special Summon Psychic Armor Head from my graveyard!

00:04:10.960 --> 00:04:14.470
I activate a spell card from my hand!

00:04:14.880 --> 00:04:16.700
Phoenix Gravitation!

00:04:16.700 --> 00:04:18.700
What?  It can't be!

00:04:18.700 --> 00:04:25.190
This spell card Special Summons four Armor Monsters from my graveyard!

00:04:25.190 --> 00:04:26.210
Resurrect!

00:04:26.210 --> 00:04:33.210
Burning Knuckle, Jet Gauntlet, Over Boost and Active Guard!

00:04:41.660 --> 00:04:44.440
Phoenix Gravitation!

00:05:08.220 --> 00:05:10.960
You played well to get this far.

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:13.630
You're a true duelist.

00:05:13.630 --> 00:05:17.200
So I’ll defeat you with all my might!

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:19.370
That's the spirit!

00:05:19.370 --> 00:05:22.440
But you're the one who'll be defeated, Valon!

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:25.680
I flip over my set card!

00:05:25.680 --> 00:05:26.940
Graverobber!

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:33.210
I took a card from your graveyard!

00:05:33.210 --> 00:05:33.940
What?

00:05:34.630 --> 00:05:35.970
Big Bang Blow!

00:05:38.620 --> 00:05:41.190
I flip over another card!

00:05:41.190 --> 00:05:42.450
Take One Chance!

00:05:43.850 --> 00:05:48.430
I draw one random card from my graveyard and activate it!

00:05:48.430 --> 00:05:50.430
I chose…

00:05:51.690 --> 00:05:52.670
Is it coming?

00:05:53.520 --> 00:05:56.970
Please bring me power!

00:06:02.140 --> 00:06:03.380
All right!

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:07.650
He drew something good again at the last moment!

00:06:08.150 --> 00:06:09.200
Here I go!

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:11.150
I activate Claw of Hermos's effect!

00:06:11.660 --> 00:06:13.730
It fuses with Big Bang Blow!

00:06:22.960 --> 00:06:26.370
Big Bang Dragon Blow!

00:06:27.780 --> 00:06:31.270
I'm going to use your weapon!

00:06:32.920 --> 00:06:36.510
This is what I was hoping for.

00:06:36.510 --> 00:06:40.200
A great duel that gets me excited!

00:06:40.200 --> 00:06:42.510
And a great duelist.

00:06:43.050 --> 00:06:46.020
This is the most fun duel ever!

00:06:46.020 --> 00:06:47.210
Here I go!

00:06:47.210 --> 00:06:48.520
This will end it!

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:50.020
Yeah!

00:06:56.020 --> 00:06:57.830
Burning Knuckle!

00:06:57.830 --> 00:07:00.500
Big Bang Dragon Blow!

00:07:09.210 --> 00:07:10.860
What’s that?

00:07:31.160 --> 00:07:33.200
It’s been fun!

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:35.170
It was the best duel ever!

00:07:35.170 --> 00:07:36.880
Same for me!

00:07:38.570 --> 00:07:39.740
Jonouchi!

00:07:41.330 --> 00:07:44.740
I activate Big Bang Dragon Blow's effect!

00:07:49.580 --> 00:07:55.250
By tributing a monster, all your monsters are destroyed.

00:07:55.250 --> 00:07:59.930
And you take damage equal to their total attack points!

00:08:21.090 --> 00:08:22.340
I lose.

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:27.580
Mai!

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:29.820
I…

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:31.650
Don’t look at me like that.

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:37.330
No matter who you cared for, I thought I could make you fall for me.

00:08:37.740 --> 00:08:39.830
But I failed.

00:08:40.350 --> 00:08:44.830
I may look pathetic, but I have no regrets.

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:46.090
Valon...

00:08:48.940 --> 00:08:51.580
Jonouchi, take care of Mai.

00:08:51.960 --> 00:08:52.860
Right.

00:08:55.120 --> 00:08:56.300
Valon!

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:24.770
So you lost, Valon.

00:09:27.640 --> 00:09:31.780
Your soul will nourish our god.

00:09:32.340 --> 00:09:37.130
You’re next, Mai Kujaku.

00:09:37.130 --> 00:09:39.940
Show the darkness in your heart.

00:09:44.820 --> 00:09:46.560
Valon!

00:09:47.490 --> 00:09:48.570
Valon...

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:57.570
Mai, you and I are the same.

00:09:57.570 --> 00:10:00.090
I had to keep winning to live.

00:10:00.090 --> 00:10:04.580
But I finally found a reason to win.

00:10:05.630 --> 00:10:07.580
It's you, Mai.

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:11.050
Mai.

00:10:14.600 --> 00:10:16.440
What a fool.

00:10:16.440 --> 00:10:20.080
You said, "Never duel for someone else."

00:10:20.080 --> 00:10:24.540
"Duel and win for yourself."

00:10:24.540 --> 00:10:26.590
That's why you lost.

00:10:26.590 --> 00:10:28.020
Mai?

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:31.110
Valon did his best as a duelist!

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:34.960
I won’t even let you talk like that!

00:10:36.440 --> 00:10:38.620
Why are you so angry?

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:42.120
Wasn't Valon your enemy?

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:44.780
Yeah, he was.

00:10:44.780 --> 00:10:52.130
But I admire a duelist who fights with all his strength!

00:10:54.120 --> 00:10:57.330
Mai, bring it on.  Duel me.

00:10:58.840 --> 00:11:00.310
I won't run.

00:11:00.310 --> 00:11:03.840
I can only understand how you feel by dueling.

00:11:04.570 --> 00:11:05.840
Let’s do it, Mai.

00:11:05.840 --> 00:11:09.850
Let's duel with all our strength so we're left with no regrets!

00:11:35.160 --> 00:11:39.910
If you go easy on me like last time, I’ll never forgive you!

00:11:39.910 --> 00:11:42.020
Yeah, I know.

00:11:45.080 --> 00:11:48.600
Jonouchi, take care of Mai.

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:51.090
Mai!

00:11:51.440 --> 00:11:54.110
Give me everything you got!

00:11:55.450 --> 00:11:58.600
And I’ll give it my all, like a duelist!

00:11:58.600 --> 00:12:00.280
I'm counting on it!

00:12:01.610 --> 00:12:02.660
Duel!

00:12:06.720 --> 00:12:09.720
That light was from Jonouchi.

00:12:09.720 --> 00:12:13.710
This is the right direction, but where is he?

00:12:17.980 --> 00:12:19.160
This way!

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:20.980
Wait up, Yugi!

00:12:20.980 --> 00:12:22.480
Hey!

00:12:31.550 --> 00:12:35.330
Big brother, isn't it strange?

00:12:35.330 --> 00:12:36.930
No one's here.

00:12:39.450 --> 00:12:42.440
It must be due to Doma.

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:56.180
I knew it.

00:12:57.210 --> 00:12:59.490
They won't let us through.

00:12:59.490 --> 00:13:00.460
Big brother!

00:13:00.460 --> 00:13:04.360
I have no time to waste on you weaklings.

00:13:04.360 --> 00:13:06.960
But if you won't let me through...

00:13:06.960 --> 00:13:09.260
…I’ll make you by force!

00:13:19.780 --> 00:13:21.980
My turn!  I draw!

00:13:21.980 --> 00:13:26.520
I summon Cyber Harpie in attack position!

00:13:28.080 --> 00:13:29.490
I end my turn!

00:13:29.900 --> 00:13:31.120
My turn!

00:13:33.640 --> 00:13:36.530
I'm still hurt from my last duel.

00:13:36.530 --> 00:13:39.260
But I have to do this!

00:13:40.220 --> 00:13:41.290
I draw!

00:13:44.430 --> 00:13:48.920
I summon Blue Flame Swordsman in attack position!

00:13:54.760 --> 00:13:58.010
Damn.  I can’t see well.

00:13:58.350 --> 00:14:02.520
C'mon, body.  Hang in there a little longer.

00:14:02.520 --> 00:14:05.020
I end my turn.

00:14:05.020 --> 00:14:11.020
My Cyber Harpie and your Blue Flame Swordsman both have 1800 attack points.

00:14:11.020 --> 00:14:15.530
It’s not like you to end your turn without doing anything.

00:14:15.530 --> 00:14:19.360
Don’t worry.  I’m not going easy on you.

00:14:19.360 --> 00:14:21.040
I've made up my mind.

00:14:22.680 --> 00:14:26.810
I learned something after fighting Valon.

00:14:26.810 --> 00:14:32.330
We communicated more by dueling than with words.

00:14:32.330 --> 00:14:35.820
I understood how he felt.

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:40.460
That’s why I'm taking you seriously too, Mai!

00:14:40.820 --> 00:14:45.770
Then you’ll know how I feel.

00:14:45.770 --> 00:14:49.060
And I want to know how you really feel!

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:53.200
What are you talking about?

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:55.980
You’ll never understand how I feel!

00:14:55.980 --> 00:15:00.070
How it feels to hunger for victory and keep fighting!

00:15:01.200 --> 00:15:03.400
I couldn't understand you so far.

00:15:05.320 --> 00:15:08.090
But I don’t want to give up.

00:15:10.160 --> 00:15:15.210
No matter what you're thinking, I’m just going to crush you!

00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:18.590
My turn!  I draw!

00:15:18.590 --> 00:15:24.600
I summon another Cyber Harpie in attack position!

00:15:25.050 --> 00:15:28.970
And I activate a spell card from my hand!

00:15:29.530 --> 00:15:31.050
Aero Nail!

00:15:31.890 --> 00:15:37.480
By equipping Aero Nail, Cyber Harpie gains 300 attack points!

00:15:38.360 --> 00:15:41.480
It’s her special Harpie Lady combo.

00:15:41.770 --> 00:15:44.720
Harpie attacks Blue Flame Swordsman!

00:15:54.110 --> 00:15:58.610
When Blue Flame Swordsman is destroyed, its effect activates!

00:16:02.620 --> 00:16:05.110
I can Special Summon Flame Swordsman!

00:16:10.920 --> 00:16:16.620
Flame Swordsman and your other Harpie both have 1800 attack points.

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:20.640
Do you want to attack and destroy them both, Mai?

00:16:20.640 --> 00:16:23.110
That would be a waste.

00:16:23.110 --> 00:16:27.310
If I attack, I'll make sure to shave your life points!

00:16:28.370 --> 00:16:32.630
I set a card and end my turn!

00:16:33.390 --> 00:16:39.260
Valon’s deck focused on offense, but Mai’s deck balances offense and defense.

00:16:39.260 --> 00:16:43.140
She uses spell and trap cards.

00:16:43.140 --> 00:16:47.240
If I'm not careful, she'll lock me down quickly.

00:16:51.150 --> 00:16:54.160
I’ll make you come to your senses, Mai!

00:16:54.160 --> 00:16:55.690
I tribute Scapegoat!

00:16:56.350 --> 00:16:58.530
Panther Warrior attacks!

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:03.330
I flip over my set card!

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:05.770
Harpie Lady Sparrow Formation!

00:17:11.520 --> 00:17:16.710
I can only activate this trap card when I have at least two Harpie Ladies!

00:17:16.710 --> 00:17:20.280
The flaming wings block and negate all attacks!

00:17:22.400 --> 00:17:27.190
If we continued, I may have lost.

00:17:27.760 --> 00:17:30.200
…Without telling Mai anything.

00:17:30.800 --> 00:17:32.650
That’s not acceptable.

00:17:32.650 --> 00:17:34.380
This time, I'll...

00:17:34.380 --> 00:17:35.330
My turn!

00:17:35.640 --> 00:17:36.650
I draw!

00:17:37.210 --> 00:17:38.300
All right!

00:17:38.300 --> 00:17:45.210
I tribute Flame Swordsman to summon Cyber-Tech Alligator in attack position!

00:17:52.570 --> 00:17:56.450
Cyber-Tech Alligator!  Attack Cyber Harpie!

00:18:05.190 --> 00:18:06.730
That's the spirit.

00:18:08.070 --> 00:18:10.690
I can finally play a real duel!

00:18:11.060 --> 00:18:13.940
Aero Nail's effect activates!

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:19.340
When it goes to the graveyard, I can equip it on a Harpie Lady on the field!

00:18:21.110 --> 00:18:25.320
I set a card and end my turn.

00:18:25.320 --> 00:18:28.320
I won't hold back.

00:18:28.320 --> 00:18:30.880
My turn!  I draw!

00:18:33.160 --> 00:18:34.500
I drew it.

00:18:35.040 --> 00:18:36.000
Is that...

00:18:36.000 --> 00:18:39.160
Yes.  The Seal of Orichalcos!

00:19:00.190 --> 00:19:01.110
That’s…

00:19:01.470 --> 00:19:03.380
The Seal of Orichalcos!

00:19:03.760 --> 00:19:05.400
Jonouchi is over there!

00:19:05.400 --> 00:19:07.760
If there's a Seal...

00:19:07.760 --> 00:19:08.970
We have to hurry!

00:19:19.920 --> 00:19:23.140
You can’t escape anymore.

00:19:23.140 --> 00:19:26.140
We’re the only ones here.

00:19:26.140 --> 00:19:28.110
No one will interfere.

00:19:28.110 --> 00:19:30.640
We can fight until one of us falls.

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:33.380
Right.  I won't run away.

00:19:34.040 --> 00:19:37.770
This Seal brings out the darkness in your heart.

00:19:37.770 --> 00:19:41.710
Even Yugi couldn’t overcome its power.

00:19:41.710 --> 00:19:47.160
But with this duel, I want to erase the darkness in your heart.

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:48.530
Here I go!

00:19:48.530 --> 00:19:52.660
I summon Cyber Harpie in attack position!

00:19:55.490 --> 00:20:03.180
Due to The Seal of Orichalcos's effect, Harpies gain 500 attack points!

00:20:03.530 --> 00:20:07.650
Harpie, attack Cyber-Tech Alligator!

00:20:16.820 --> 00:20:20.330
Then attack Jonouchi directly!

00:20:20.330 --> 00:20:24.060
I flip over my set card!  Scapegoat!

00:20:27.100 --> 00:20:29.400
You never give up.

00:20:29.400 --> 00:20:31.570
But I expected that move!

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:34.700
I flip over my set card!

00:20:34.700 --> 00:20:36.620
Nightmare Tri-Mirror!

00:20:40.940 --> 00:20:52.610
For every non-Normal Summoned monster you have, this trap card Special Summon a Copy Token.

00:21:05.240 --> 00:21:08.750
Harpie Lady!  Attack Scapegoat!

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:18.440
The copied Harpies can’t attack this turn.

00:21:18.440 --> 00:21:19.780
I end my turn!

00:21:20.790 --> 00:21:23.650
You fell for the same trick as last time.

00:21:23.650 --> 00:21:27.030
How pathetic, Jonouchi.

00:21:27.030 --> 00:21:28.760
Don’t say that.

00:21:28.760 --> 00:21:31.530
I've actually improved.

00:21:31.530 --> 00:21:34.530
I won't fall for your bluffs!

00:21:34.530 --> 00:21:36.680
You have nowhere to run!

00:21:36.680 --> 00:21:38.540
I'll win this time!

00:21:41.080 --> 00:21:43.000
I won't run.

00:21:43.000 --> 00:21:47.550
Mai, I'll bring you back this time!

00:21:58.240 --> 00:22:07.120
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:07.650 --> 00:22:15.490
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:17.220 --> 00:22:26.650
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:27.260 --> 00:22:36.140
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:22:36.740 --> 00:22:45.200
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:22:45.980 --> 00:22:50.710
I'll live feeling them

00:22:51.320 --> 00:22:55.860
For me to be me

00:22:55.860 --> 00:23:04.350
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:05.030 --> 00:23:09.990
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:10.510 --> 00:23:19.650
We'll both understand that someday

00:23:25.500 --> 00:23:29.210
Jonouchi defeated Valon in a fierce fight.

00:23:29.210 --> 00:23:33.420
But with no time to rest, he begins dueling Mai.

00:23:33.420 --> 00:23:39.690
Jonouchi wants to know how Mai feels, and let her know how he feels.

00:23:39.690 --> 00:23:46.440
But he's damaged from his duel with Valon, ready to collapse at any time.

00:23:46.440 --> 00:23:49.530
Will Jonouchi's emotions reach Mai?

00:23:49.530 --> 00:23:51.630
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Bitter Victory

00:23:51.630 --> 00:23:53.160
Duel, standby!
